og-on-Beach-Print-Res-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMjg4MCwxODAwXQ.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85 1200w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-Dog-on-Beach-Print-Res-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMjg4MCwxODAwXQ.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=85 1920w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-Dog-on-Beach-Print-Res-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMjg4MCwxODAwXQ.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=85 2048w, /_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-Dog-on-Beach-Print-Res-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMjg4MCwxODAwXQ.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbackend.nelsontasman.nz%2Fassets%2Flistings%2Ftahunanui-beach%2FWalking-Dog-on-Beach-Print-Res-taken-by-Oliver-Weber-credit-www__FocusFillMaxWyIwLjAwIiwiMC4wMCIsMjg4MCwxODAwXQ.nelsontasman.nz.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=85"/></div><div class="flex justify-between font-sans text-sm text-neutral rounded-b"><div class="p-4 empty:hidden md:truncate"></div><div class="hidden p-4 md:block">2<!-- -->/<!-- -->2</div></div></div></div></div><button class="no-underline font-sans inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap md:text-normal font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-white bg-transparent text-white hover:bg-sky hover:text-white hover:border-sky absolute h-10 w-10 rounded-full left-5 top-1/2 -translate-y-full disabled:hidden" disabled=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left h-6 w-6"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"></path><path d="M19 12H5"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Previous slide</span></button><button class="no-underline font-sans inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap md:text-normal font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-white bg-transparent text-white hover:bg-sky hover:text-white hover:border-sky absolute h-10 w-10 rounded-full right-5 top-1/2 -translate-y-full disabled:hidden" disabled=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-6 w-6"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Next slide</span></button></div></div><div class="mb-12 grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-4"><div class="prose col-span-3 lg:prose-lg xl:prose-xl"><p class="mb-12">Locals and holidaymakers often paddle or swim to Arrow (Fifeshire) Rock, Haulashore Island or the historic Boulder Bank to explore the attractions nestled along the coast. At the beach&#x27;s eastern end, low tide reveals an exciting collection of rockpools, abundant with small crabs, fish, and sea snails left lingering with the ebb and flow of the ocean. Just above the rockpools is a pier extending into the bay, where keen fisherman flock at all times of the year to cast their line and reel in a catch.<br/><br/>Tāhunanui is loosely translated in Māori to mean big (nui) sandbank (tahuna), which certainly lives up to its name. The beach is a popular destination for sunbathing, swimming, paddle boarding, kitesurfing and kayaking, whilst behind the rolling dunes is a family-friendly outdoor playground like no other. Dogs are not permitted on the two eastern thirds of Tāhunanui Beach, and dog walking is only allowed on Back Beach.</p><h4>Contact details</h4><p><strong>Address: </strong>Rocks Road, <!-- -->Nelson City<!-- --> <!-- -->7010<br/></p></div><div class="space-y-6"></div></div></div><div class="overflow-y-scroll bg-sky-light lg:flex lg:h-[500px] xl:h-[700px]"><div class="prose w-full p-4 md:p-8 lg:w-1/3 xl:w-1/4"><h4 class=""> Proximity To Town</h4><p class="">5 minutes</p><h4 class=""> Proximity To Airport</h4><p class="">5 minutes</p><h4 class=""> Parking</h4><p class="">Free</p><p><a class="no-underline font-sans inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded md:text-normal font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-transparent text-black border-black border hover:bg-black hover:text-white h-10 px-4 py-2" target="_blank" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=-41.27910203,173.25096717">Directions<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link ms-2"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></p></div><div class="h-[500px] grow xl:h-[700px]"><div style="position:relative;width:100%;height:100%"></div></div></div><div class="container prose prose-sm max-w-screen-lg py-12"><h4>The content on this page was created by <!-- -->Tāhunanui Beach</h4><p>This website helps visitors connect with providers of great New Zealand tourism experiences. It is not intended to give any assurance that any particular provider meets certain quality standards or legal obligations.</p><p>Please contact this business for more information. See also<!-- --> <a target="_blank" href="/disclaimer/">nelsontasman.nz terms of use.</a></p></div><footer class="relative flex flex-col justify-center gap-12 bg-sky pt-12 text-white md:pt-20 lg:pt-28"><div class="container flex flex-col flex-wrap items-start justify-start gap-12 md:flex-row md:justify-between xl:flex-nowrap"><div class="flex basis-full flex-col gap-8 self-center xl:basis-1/4 xl:self-start"><a class="mx-auto inline-block w-64 sm:w-72" aria-label="Home" href="/"></a><div class="flex justify-center"><a target="_blank" class="no-underline font-sans inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded md:text-normal font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 underline-offset-4 hover:underline h-10 py-2 text-white px-2" href="https://www.facebook.com/nelsontasmannz/"><span class="sr-only">Facebook</span></a><a target="_blank" class="no-underline font-sans inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded md:text-normal font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 underline-offset-4 hover:underline h-10 py-2 text-white px-2" href="https://www.instagram.com/nelsontasmannz/"><span class="sr-only">Instagram</span></a><a target="_blank" class="no-underline font-sans inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded md:text-normal font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 underline-offset-4 hover:underline h-10 py-2 text-white px-2" href="https://www.youtube.com/@NelsonTasmanNZ"><span class="sr-only">Youtube</span></a><a target="_blank" cl