, swimming, paddle boarding, kitesurfing and kayaking, whilst behind the rolling dunes is a family-friendly outdoor playground like no other. Dogs are not permitted on the two eastern thirds of Tāhunanui Beach, and dog walking is only allowed on Back Beach.\"]}],\"\",[null,null,\"\",null,null,null,null,null],[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"children\":\"Contact details\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Address: \"}],\"Rocks Road, \",[\"Nelson City\",\" \",\"7010\"],[\"$\",\"br\",null,{}]],\"\",\"\",\"\"]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-6\",\"children\":[]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3a:[false,[]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"overflow-y-scroll bg-sky-light lg:flex lg:h-[500px] xl:h-[700px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose w-full p-4 md:p-8 lg:w-1/3 xl:w-1/4\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"ProximityToTown\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":\" Proximity To Town\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":\"5 minutes\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"ProximityToAirport\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":\" Proximity To Airport\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":\"5 minutes\"}]]}],null,[\"$\",\"$1\",\"Parking\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":\" Parking\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":\"Free\"}]]}]],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1\u0026query=-41.27910203,173.25096717\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"children\":[\"Directions\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide